                    <span>WhatsApp Booking</span>
                </a>
                <a href="tel:07304432681" class="hidden sm:inline-flex bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white px-3.5 py-2 sm:py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-sm transition-all">
                    Call Desk
                </a>
