                    Precision Braces. <br/>
                    <span class="text-teal-700">World-Class Dental Care.</span>
                </h1>

                <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl break-words">
                    Welcome to <strong>Infinora Dental Care</strong> in Kandivali West, Mumbai. Directed by MDS Orthodontist <strong>Dr. Riddhi Patel Shah</strong> alongside a dedicated panel of post-graduate MDS specialists across every dental discipline. Experience anxiety-free, hospital-grade dental healthcare.
                </p>

                <!-- Launch Banner Card -->
                <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 via-teal-950 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-xl border border-teal-700/40 space-y-2.5">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
                        <span class="bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-teal-500/30">
                            Grand Opening · September 2026
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-amber-300 font-bold">Limited Pre-Launch Privilege</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white">Join the VIP Pre-Launch Register</h2>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mt-0.5">
                            Pre-register to claim a <strong>Free Comprehensive Specialist Assessment + 3D Scan + 20% Privilege Discount</strong> on inaugural procedures.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-1">
                        <a href="https://wa.me/917304432681?text=Hi%20Dr.%20Riddhi%2C%20I%20want%20to%20claim%20the%20Infinora%20Inaugural%20Launch%20Privilege%20Pass%20for%20September%202026." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-400 text-slate-950 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-md">
                            Claim Privilege Pass on WhatsApp &rarr;
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Primary CTAs -->
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-1">
                    <a href="https://wa.me/917304432681?text=Hello%20Dr.%20Riddhi%20Patel%20Shah%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20a%20priority%20consultation." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-teal-700 hover:bg-teal-800 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-teal-700/25 transition-all text-sm sm:text-base text-center">
                        Book Specialist Consultation
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#tourism" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-slate-800 font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition-all text-sm sm:text-base text-center">
                        ✈️ Dental Tourism & NRIs
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Trust Badges -->
                <div class="pt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-3.5 border-t border-slate-200">
                    <div class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm text-center sm:text-left">
                        <div class="text-base sm:text-xl font-black text-slate-900">MDS Only</div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">All Specialty Leads</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-2.5 sm:p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm text-center sm:text-left">
