                            👩‍⚕️
                        </div>
                        <div class="min-w-0">
                            <h2 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base sm:text-lg leading-tight truncate">Dr. Riddhi Patel Shah</h2>
                            <p class="text-xs text-teal-700 font-bold tracking-wide">MDS – Orthodontics & Dentofacial Orthopedics</p>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium">Founder & Chief Dental Surgeon</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed break-words">
                        <p>
                            At <strong>Infinora Dental Care</strong>, every patient treatment is managed by credentialed post-graduate specialists holding Master of Dental Surgery (MDS) degrees.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            We reject one-doctor-does-all approaches. Your root canals are handled by endodontists, your implants by maxillofacial surgeons, and your teeth alignments by our MDS Orthodontist.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Specialist Roster -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-3.5 border border-slate-100 space-y-2 text-xs">
                        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-800">
                            Specialist Clinical Board
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-700 font-medium">
                            <div>• <strong>Orthodontist (MDS):</strong> Aligners & Braces</div>
                            <div>• <strong>Endodontist (MDS):</strong> Microscopic RCT</div>
                            <div>• <strong>Oral Surgeon (MDS):</strong> Implants & Wisdom</div>
                            <div>• <strong>Prosthodontist (MDS):</strong> Full Mouth Rehab</div>
                            <div>• <strong>Periodontist (MDS):</strong> Laser Gum Surgery</div>
                            <div>• <strong>Pedodontist (MDS):</strong> Kids Dentistry</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-1">
                        <a href="https://wa.me/917304432681?text=Hi%20Dr.%20Riddhi%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20case%20with%20your%20specialist%20team." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="w-full text-center py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-teal-700 hover:bg-teal-800 text-white text-xs font-bold block transition-colors shadow-md">
                            Direct WhatsApp Consultation &rarr;
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HIGH TICKET FOCUS 1: Clear Aligners & Precision Orthodontics -->
    <section id="aligners" class="py-16 bg-white w-full border-t border-slate-100">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
                
                <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5 min-w-0">
                    <span class="text-teal-700 text-xs font-extrabold tracking-widest uppercase bg-teal-100/80 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full">
                        Flagship Orthodontic Studio
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
                        Invisible Clear Aligners & Aesthetic Braces
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                        Led directly by MDS Orthodontist <strong>Dr. Riddhi Patel Shah</strong>. We map your smile using 3D intraoral optical scanning to construct precision clear aligners that move teeth safely, predictably, and invisibly without metal brackets or food restrictions.
                    </p>

                    <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <span class="text-teal-600 font-bold text-base shrink-0">✓</span>
                            <div><strong>3D Digital Simulation:</strong> Preview your completed smile before your first tray is fabricated.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <span class="text-teal-600 font-bold text-base shrink-0">✓</span>
                            <div><strong>Virtually Invisible:</strong> High-grade medical thermoplastic trays that go unnoticed in meetings or events.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <span class="text-teal-600 font-bold text-base shrink-0">✓</span>
                            <div><strong>Zero Dietary Restrictions:</strong> Remove trays effortlessly to eat, brush, and floss normally.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <span class="text-teal-600 font-bold text-base shrink-0">✓</span>
                            <div><strong>MDS Specialized Oversight:</strong> Guaranteed biological tooth safety with no root shortening or gum damage.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-2">
                        <a href="https://wa.me/917304432681?text=Hi%20Dr.%20Riddhi%2C%20I%20want%20to%20inquire%20about%20Clear%20Aligners%20and%20Teeth%20Alignment." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-teal-700 hover:bg-teal-800 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-md transition-all">
                            Book Clear Aligner Scan & Assessment &rarr;
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-5 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
                    <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white">Compare Orthodontic Solutions</h3>
                    <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                        
                        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700 space-y-1">
                            <div class="flex justify-between font-bold text-teal-300">
                                <span>Invisible Clear Aligners</span>
                                <span>Top Choice for Adults</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                                Custom transparent aligners. Removable, zero mouth sores, ideal for working professionals and brides.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700 space-y-1">
                            <div class="flex justify-between font-bold text-teal-300">
                                <span>Self-Ligating Ceramic Braces</span>
                                <span>Discreet & Fixed</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                                Tooth-colored ceramic brackets that blend with your enamel. Low friction, faster alignment, and fewer clinic visits.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700 space-y-1">
                            <div class="flex justify-between font-bold text-teal-300">
                                <span>Advanced Metallic Braces</span>
                                <span>Precision Mechanics</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                                High-grade stainless steel brackets for complex skeletal corrections and interceptive teenage orthodontics.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HIGH TICKET FOCUS 2: Global Dental Tourism & NRI Concierge -->
    <section id="tourism" class="py-16 bg-slate-900 text-white w-full relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 space-y-3">
                <span class="text-teal-400 text-xs font-extrabold tracking-widest uppercase bg-teal-950 border border-teal-800 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full">
                    World-Class Care · 70% Cost Advantage
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
                    International Dental Tourism & NRI Concierge
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Patients and NRIs from the United Kingdom, USA, Australia, New Zealand, and UAE travel to Mumbai for world-class dental restorations, All-on-4/6 implants, and smile makeovers with international warranty-backed materials (Straumann, Nobel Biocare, E.max).
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Tourism Advantage Cards -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-10">
                <div class="bg-slate-800/80 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 space-y-3">
                    <div class="text-2xl">💰</div>
                    <h3 class="font-extrabold text-base text-white">Massive Cost Savings</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Full mouth dental implants and smile makeovers cost up to 70–80% less than in Sydney, London, New York, or Dubai—using identical premium European materials.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-slate-800/80 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 space-y-3">
                    <div class="text-2xl">⚡</div>
                    <h3 class="font-extrabold text-base text-white">Priority Fast-Track Schedule</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Zero waiting lists. International itineraries are condensed into express 5–10 day treatment windows without compromising surgical healing standards.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-slate-800/80 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 space-y-3">
                    <div class="text-2xl">🤝</div>
                    <h3 class="font-extrabold text-base text-white">Dedicated Travel Concierge</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Assistance with local accommodation near the clinic in Mumbai, airport transfer guidance, and dedicated WhatsApp coordinator throughout your trip.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3-Step Remote Plan Blueprint -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-950 to-slate-950 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-teal-700/40 space-y-6">
                <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-teal-300 text-center">
                    How Remote Planning Works (Before You Fly to Mumbai)
                </h3>
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-1.5">
                        <div class="text-teal-400 font-black text-base">Step 1</div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-white">Send X-Rays / Photos</div>
                        <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                            Share your OPG X-ray, CBCT scan, or smile photos over WhatsApp (+91 73044 32681) or email.
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-1.5">
                        <div class="text-teal-400 font-black text-base">Step 2</div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-white">Virtual Video Consult</div>
                        <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
