                        <div class="text-teal-400 font-black text-base">Step 3</div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-white">Arrive & Complete Care</div>
                        <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                            Fly to Mumbai, complete treatments in planned priority sessions, and return home with a transformed, healthy smile.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="text-center pt-2">
                    <a href="https://wa.me/917304432681?text=Hello%20Infinora%2C%20I%20am%20an%20International%20Patient%20/%20NRI%20inquiring%20about%20Dental%20Treatment%20in%20Mumbai." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-400 text-slate-950 font-black px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-lg transition-all">
                        Connect with Dental Tourism Desk on WhatsApp &rarr;
